# Pass 7: Make Honey EVEN MORE Compatible (TSP.zal.patchhoney2), the optional mod this port patches for its honey syrup
# recipe. Select it with `-DepMap wsl-deps.make-honey.map`; the report carries the pass name `make-honey`.
#
# Its two hard dependencies (About.xml, read 2026-10-09) are staged before it: Universal Processor
# (syrchalis.processor.framework) and Make Honey Compatibile Patch (zal.patchhoney). The recipe under test is
# KYD_HoneySyrup, defined in that mod's own 1.6 Defs; its ingredient list names `zal.patchhoney` categories, so
# the base patch has to be there for the recipe to load without errors.
#
# Order does not matter for the patch (patches run on the merged document), so this mod is not named in the map:
# the staging adds it after the mods of the map.
